From bbc5c193a9e7194119dd34c27c63b6660c44ed45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:56:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] audioreach: add legacy TDM sink module and device
 subgraph

Add the legacy SPF TDM sink module (0x0700100E) with a playback device
subgraph [MFC] -> [TDM EP] and DEVICE_TDM_SG_ADD, which takes the frame
geometry (slots per frame, slot width) and the frame sync setup (sync
source, data out enable, sync mode, sync pulse polarity, data delay) on
top of the DEVICE_SG_ADD arguments. The module carries the hardware
interface type and index, the data format and those settings as
tokens 262 to 269.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 audioreach/audioreach.m4                   | 16 ++++++++
 audioreach/device-subgraph.m4              | 16 ++++++++
 audioreach/module_tdm.m4                   | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 audioreach/subgraph-device-tdm-playback.m4 | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 audioreach/tokens.m4                       |  7 ++++
 5 files changed, 135 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 audioreach/module_tdm.m4
